[
  {
    "id": "7340",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_part4_1",
    "en": "In this lesson, you will learn how to deal with such obstacles in a fast and safe way by using the brakes slightly to steady the car. Pay extra attention to the different technique zones before the jumps."
  },
  {
    "id": "7341",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_trigger1_1",
    "en": "Ok, accelerate up to the stated speed."
  },
  {
    "id": "7342",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_trigger2_1",
    "en": "Brake at the Jump and then accelerate before take off."
  },
  {
    "id": "7343",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_trigger3a_1",
    "en": "The road turns left after the next jump."
  },
  {
    "id": "7344",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_trigger3b_1",
    "en": "The road turns right after the next jump."
  },
  {
    "id": "7345",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson010_trigger4_1",
    "en": "Brake before the Watersplash and enter as straight as possible."
  },
  {
    "id": "7346",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson011_part1_1",
    "en": "Rally1 cars in the top tier of the WRC use hybrid technology to combine a combustion engine with an electric boost."
  },
  {
    "id": "7347",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson011_part2_1",
    "en": "A hybrid unit is fitted to each car, giving a boost of up to 130 horse power during acceleration, which is then regenerated under braking."
  },
  {
    "id": "7348",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson011_part3_1",
    "en": "There are 3 different boost options to choose from, that set the access to the boost depending on how far down the throttle has travelled, these can be set in the service area before tackling the upcoming stages."
  },
  {
    "id": "7349",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson011_part4_1",
    "en": "On one end of the scale you have the cautious option, that will only deploy boost on throttle input above 70%, allowing more control around technical stages. On the other end of the scale is the agressive option, that is set at a throttle input of just 30%, giving quicker access to the hybrid boost."
  },
  {
    "id": "7350",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson011_part5_1",
    "en": "We have managed to get a Rally1 car for you to take for a test drive, use this opportunity to learn how the hybrid boost is deployed when accelerating and how it is regenerated under braking."
  },
  {
    "id": "7351",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson012_trigger1_1",
    "en": "Well, you've got all the skills at your disposal now to become a champion rally driver. You just have one final lesson, to put it all into practice on a section of a Rally stage"
  },
  {
    "id": "7352",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson012_trigger2_1",
    "en": "Co-driver calls will help you navigate the turns and obstacles, so pay close attention, and try to anticipate your next move."
  },
  {
    "id": "7353",
    "k": "lng_cd_rally_school_lesson012_trigger3_1",
    "en": "It will be important to get into a good rhythm from the start, and maintain that throughout the stage by utilising everything in your rallying toolbox. When you cross the finish line, you will need to come to a stop at the marshal control zone. Good luck!"
  },
